    "Program your own compatible ESP host hardware from a desktop browser. The library and device stubs are hosted on this site. This is a hardware setup tool; it does not jailbreak a console.": "Programmez votre ESP compatible depuis un navigateur de bureau. Bibliothèque et stubs sont hébergés ici. Cet outil configure le matériel, sans jailbreaker la console.",
